H='（聽力稿，原題播放兩次）\n'
P='（聽力稿）選出最適合的回應：\n'
PIC='\n請選出符合描述的圖片。'
PS=[]
D=[
(1,H+'Peter is watching videos on his phone when taking a train to Taipei.'+PIC,['圖(A)','圖(B)','圖(C)'],[('el-2',140,650,1225,935)]),
(2,H+'The dog is so cute. Amy is playing with it, but her brother is afraid of the dog.'+PIC,['圖(A)','圖(B)','圖(C)'],[('el-2',140,977,1225,1262)]),
(3,H+'There are a lot of yummy cookies on the table, but few people are eating them.'+PIC,['圖(A)','圖(B)','圖(C)'],[('el-2',140,1305,1225,1595)]),
(4,P+'Dad, it’s raining heavily. Can you drive me to school today?',['Sure. Finish your breakfast first.','All right. Let’s wait for the bus.','No problem. My car needs cleaning.'],[]),
(5,P+'Excuse me, how can I get to the Taipei Bus Station?',['I got there once.','The bus station is so big.','You can ask the police officer over there.'],[]),
(6,P+'Oh, my! The ground is shaking!',['Let’s mop the floor together.','An earthquake! Hide under the table!','You can go back to sleep.'],[]),
(7,P+'How often do you visit your grandparents in the country?',['Every two weeks.','At least for a month.','On Sunday afternoon.'],[]),
(8,P+'The blue jacket looks great on you. Where did you buy it?',['It cost me only one hundred dollars.','The jacket is very bright and cool.','It is a birthday present from my dad.'],[]),
(9,P+'Amy looked at Ben so angrily just now. What happened?',['Ben helped Amy with her homework.','Ben broke Amy’s favorite cup.','Ben planned to celebrate Amy’s birthday.'],[]),
(10,P+'Paul and I are going to the movies this evening. Will you join us?',['Really? What day is it?','Why not? I’m glad to go with you.','Of course. I have a meeting then.'],[]),
(11,P+'What’s that smell from the kitchen? It smells great.',['Mia is baking a banana cake.','The cake is very expensive.','Mom is washing the dishes there.'],[]),
(12,H+'（廣播音樂）M: Good morning, everyone. This morning, something terrible happened in front of our school. A car ran away after it hit a student. The student was badly hurt, and he is in hospital now. The student was using his cellphone when walking across the road. That is very dangerous. Please be careful and watch out for the cars on the road. Don’t let your cellphone take away your life.\nQ: Which picture shows what happened this morning?',['圖(A)','圖(B)','圖(C)'],[('el-4',140,495,1225,775)]),
(13,H+'G: You and Ms. Brown know each other? What a surprise!\nB: Ha! Ms. Brown is one of my mom’s best friends. She often visits my mom and has dinner with us on the weekend.\nG: I see! Ms. Brown is an English teacher at my school. She teaches well, and all the students like her English class.\nB: She is really a nice person. She always helps me with my English homework. You are lucky to have a teacher like her.\nQ: What do we know about Ms. Brown?',['She knows the girl’s mom very well.','She is the boy’s English teacher.','Her English class is popular.'],[]),
(14,H+'W: Take a look at this picture. What do you think about this one?\nM: The living room is big. However, there are only two rooms.\nW: You’re right. I’ll also need a garden to plant flowers.\nM: Look! The one next to it looks great.\nW: I don’t think so. The kitchen is too small. Besides, we’ll need two bathrooms.\nM: I couldn’t agree with you more. I don’t want to wait when I need to use the bathroom in the early morning.\nQ: What do they want to buy?',['Flowers.','A house.','A picture.'],[]),
(15,H+'M: What are you looking for?\nW: I am looking for my chopsticks and spoon.\nM: You don’t need to. There are chopsticks and spoons on the table. Just use them.\nW: No. These will become trash. We have made too much trash in our life, and I don’t want to make more.\nM: All right, but even though you don’t use them, others will.\nW: I know. Saving the earth is not a habit to many people, so I always try to have people around me do the same. This way, there will be less and less trash.\nQ: What’s important for the woman?',['To live a convenient life.','To help cut down the trash.','To ask others to eat healthy food.'],[]),
(16,H+'M: Hi. Check out, please.\nW: No problem. Is that all?\nM: Yes, please.\nW: OK, wait a minute. The total is NT$290. By the way, when you spend NT$50, you can get a point. Do you want to buy something more to get 6 points?\nM: Why not? Let me see. I can buy the candy. It only costs NT$15.\nW: Great! Here are your six points. Thank you and have a nice day.\nQ: How much did the man pay in total?',['NT$290.','NT$300.','NT$305.'],[]),
(17,H+'（下課鐘聲）B: Tim asked you out last Saturday. Why didn’t you go out with him?\nG: Well, he is not my type.\nB: Come on! He is tall and handsome. He is also a great basketball player. Almost every girl at the school is crazy about him.\nG: Well, I know he is very popular. However, he often goes to school late and sleeps in class. I don’t think he is a good student.\nB: Oh, I see. You are a good student, and you want to make friends with students just like you.\nG: That’s right!\nQ: What does the girl mean by saying “he is not my type”?',['She doesn’t like Tim.','Tim is good at basketball.','Lots of girls like Tim.'],[]),
(18,H+'（車輛經過的聲音）M: You look beautiful in this pink dress. It really goes well with your hair.\nW: Thanks. I bought it at Nina’s Shop. It just opened last week.\nM: My wife’s birthday is coming. Maybe I should go there and buy a dress as her birthday gift.\nW: You are really a good husband. By the way, if you say something good about them on their Facebook, you can get a small gift from them.\nM: That’s great. Could you tell me where Nina’s Shop is?\nW: OK, let me check it on my cellphone. Wait a minute.\nQ: What is the woman going to do next?',['Use her cellphone.','Make a phone call to Nina.','Buy a dress for the man’s wife.'],[]),
(19,H+'（下雨聲）M: Hey! What happened to you, Erica? Why are you all wet?\nW: It was raining hard on my way to the office.\nM: Didn’t you bring an umbrella? It started raining early this morning.\nW: I did. But someone took it away when I was having my breakfast at the burger house. I put it outside the shop. When I was going to leave, I found it was gone.\nM: Poor you!\nW: （嘆息聲）Getting wet is not a big deal to me. But I really hope I can get my umbrella back. I bought that umbrella in Japan. It is my favorite.\nM: Maybe you can ask the owner of the burger house. Hope you can get it back!\nQ: Where did Erica lose her umbrella?',['At her office.','In Japan.','At the burger house.'],[]),
(20,H+'W: Your teacher, Mr. Smith, called me last night.\nB: What did he say?\nW: He told me you copied Alice’s answers on the math test. Why did you do that?\nB: I am sorry, Mom. Math is really difficult to me. I didn’t understand the questions on the test. I won’t do that again. Can I have one more chance?\nW: Fine, but you have to study hard to prepare for the math test next time.\nB: All right, Mom.\nQ: Why was the boy’s mom unhappy?',['Her son called Mr. Smith.','Her son cheated on the test.','Her son didn’t like math.'],[]),
(21,H+'（廣播聲音）M: Good morning, everyone! Welcome to Paula’s Flower Garden, one of the most beautiful gardens in this city. Paula Parker built this garden three years ago. In this flower garden, you can get to know many kinds of flowers. If you want to learn more about these flowers, I can also share some knowledge with you. We also have special flower tea. You can try it at some shops in the garden. There are also delicious meals with flowers in them. They are yummy and smell great. You won’t want to miss them! Now, let me show you around the garden. Please feel free to take pictures here. Enjoy your time! Hope you all have a wonderful day!\nQ: What can we know about Paula’s Flower Garden?',['It is rich in history.','You can eat special food with flowers there.','Paula Parker shows people around the garden.'],[]),
]
